    "start": 52.714,
    "end": 59.475,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Yes, the main idea of this Centennial celebration, I always say, is these two aspects.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_7",
    "start": 60.298,
    "end": 65.281,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Another one is in order to commemorate previous Khyentse Rinpoche.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_8",
    "start": 66.422,
    "end": 74.727,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So wherever we have the celebration, we always have like one day offering and remembering of Khyentse Rinpoche.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_9",
