    "end": 78.129,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And then the movie with movie and stories.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_10",
    "start": 78.87,
    "end": 86.795,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So somehow the people who met Khyentse Rinpoche has very strong impact on their life by meeting Khyentse Rinpoche.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
