    "start": 91.354,
    "end": 115.13,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "previous Khyentse Rinpoche and another aspect is to introduce now we have this wonderful Khyentse Rinpoche so introduce Khyentse Rinpoche to his previous life student and something which I didn't think but it happened is that now that he could really see that how much people really loved Khyentse Rinpoche and how much",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
