    "end": 121.3,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "people really effected in their life what his balance is and did this something, his soho.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_13",
    "start": 122.161,
    "end": 123.882,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I think that was wonderful.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_14",
    "start": 125.403,
    "end": 138.913,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Organizer",
    "text": "Could you help to say something about the relationship or the kinship between, in your experience, between the His Holiness Dilgo Khyentse Rinpoche and now the new Khyentse Rinpoche?",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_15",
    "start": 143.517,
    "end": 143.777,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Well,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
