    "start": 161.868,
    "end": 172.395,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And of course, there is still very much something about him that really reminds us of the previous Khyentse Rinpoche.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_19",
    "start": 173.296,
    "end": 176.078,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And for me it is very interesting because it is like the first time",
