    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So, of course, Yangsi Rinpoche has to go through all the studies and all that, because that's how the bodhisattvas do.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
